{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"301"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、高校生になったら東京に出て来るんだよね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京のここが苦手ってとこある???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうですよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の苦手なとこねーどこだろう...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"302"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじの画像は大吉ですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれはひめたんではなくてひめたんファミリーってことですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんを含めた中元ふぁみりーってことにしておこっかな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかゆーてみる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際大吉引いたのはひめたんの妹かな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"303"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔でも今でもいいけど憧れの人っている?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Perfumeセンパイっ(//∀//)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長かったであろう下積みの時代から真面目に努力して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにビックになった素敵な先輩たち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか認めてもらえなかったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛い事があった時も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"諦めないで夢を叶えて輝いている先輩たちがいるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん諦めないし頑張れる♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"304"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お餅を2分の1個って少なっ!ダイエットしてるのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー最近は食事には気を配るようにしとる(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"305"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめにょんって絵うまいの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃは(ω)★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"306"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは野球好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ前に同じ質問あったけど、もう一回？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルールとか全然わからんけど、野球少年はかっこいいと思います(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにひめたんに野球をさせたら大変なことになります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピッチャーとキャッチャーの違いがわかるレベル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"307"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度広島行った時ひめたんに案内してもらおうかな?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいーよろこんで!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいコースをプランニングして待っとるけえ、いつでも広島きてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(∀)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"308"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式なんだ(o^∀^o)ひめたんお祝いの言葉が欲しいなあ↑↑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなっちゃってごめんなさい('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は成人の日だったんよね。新成人の方おめでとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うらやましいー。ひめたんも早く成人式参加したいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生のセンパイ!これからの日本を引っ張って行ってくださいな(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"309"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな長文読むの「たいぎー」よね?(笑)使い方あってる?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使い方はあっとるけど、ひめたんはそんなこと思っとらんよ(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめきゅんさんほんまにありがとうございました!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"310"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは夢叶う矢にお願いするとしたら何をお願いする??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お願いしたいことはいっぱいあるけどー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちばんに何を叶えてもらおっかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと飛躍したい。ぴょーん(ω)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"311"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真に写ってる合格御守はひめたんの高校受験用かな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーん(∀)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんにはお守りとひめきゅんのみなさんがついてるから大丈夫♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"312"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんって朝は強い方、弱い方?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学1年生〜5年生までラジオ体操は皆勤賞、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8年間9ヶ月の学生生活は無遅刻、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで寝坊なんて無縁だったんですひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...最近、お仕事するようになってから起きれんくなったけど('・・`)ちーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"313"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れない限り毎日コメしてるんだよ!知ってた?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らんて言ったら泣くぞY(>_<、)Y"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知っとる!ひめたん知っとるよーお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってコメ返めっちゃチェックしよるもん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃけ泣かんでー(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"314"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの更新回数一日あたりの上限あるの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂はふりーだむ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日何回更新しても、何日に1回更新しても自由って制度ですー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運営委員がひそかにカウントしてるって噂ぢゃけどね(//ω//)きゃは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"315"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはカキの土手鍋って知ってるは手鍋って知ってる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当然!広島の名産品じゃないですかー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きすきっ(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の時期に広島行ったら絶対おすすめぢゃーあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"316"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはアニメは何が好きかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそのアニメのストーリーではどこ辺りの話が好きかなーん話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃいときはアニメよくみとったけど、最近全然見とらん('・・`)けど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けいおんの曲は割とうたえるんですよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメのアニメとかってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"317"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメな漫画ってありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画も最近あんまり読んでない('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少女漫画にハマりたい時期があったりもした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの周りはワンピースふぁん多いっけなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かオススメな漫画ありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"318"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか野球は二回でてたけどバスどうなったん?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HPの見たら結構できてるように見えたけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん２年間だけバスケ同好会に入っとったんよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃけシュートする時のフォームはよく褒めてもらえる(*^^*)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際シュート率はだめだめだけれども。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/16/9666317/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}